        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek E2020, Keypad Door Lock</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Brass Keypad Leverset is the perfect choice to control who can enter a room. This Keypad Leverset has has two functions: Locked Mode and Passage Mode. See below for more details. The Modern Keypad Leverset can be programmed with up to 20 codes and comes factory programmed with 2 unique codes so you can use your new electronic door lock right away. It is easy to install and will fit many pre-drilled doors. Choose your backset and your trim lever.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nYour Electronic Keypad can be used two ways by simply turing the button on the interior rose.\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>Passage Function in Locked Mode:</b> Outside lever is always locked and requires the use of a code or the back-up key for entry. The inside lever is always free.\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Passage Function in Passage Mode:</b> Outside and Inside lever are always free. No code or the key needed for entry.\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Emtek E2020 Touch Pad Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to use installation and programming instructions included.</li> \r\n<li>Factory programmed with 2 unique, secure user codes for use right out of the box.</li> \r\n<li>Can be programmed with up to 20 user codes of your choice.</li> \r\n<li>Codes can be added and deleted.</li> \r\n<li>Easy lock operation, simply push the Emtek button and turn the exterior thumb turn to lock.</li> \r\n<li>Easy unlock operation, enter the 4 digit code and turn the exterior thumb turn.</li> \r\n<li>Programming changes can be made easily using the keypad.</li> \r\n<li>Illuminated keypad for easy and quick operation after dark.</li> \r\n<li>Low battery indicator lets you know when it’s time to change the battery.</li> \r\n<li>Backup Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>Used 9-volt battery</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Modern Brass Electronic Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 6-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Button Size: 1/4\" W x 3/8\" H</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Package includes: latch, strike plate, and 9-volt battery.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-E2020-specifications.pdf?v=1704262431\"><b>Emtek E2020 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
